#EXTM3U
#
# Default stations for new Pudding installs. Keep this as an extended M3U so it
# is easy to edit by hand and remains usable in other media players. This file
# is copied to the user's writable streams.m3u8 only when that file is first
# created; changes here never replace an existing personal station list.
#
# Stations are included only with permission from their operators.
# Permission from SomaFM received 9/17/26 for specific stations, a few of which
# I chose to include.

